sentences.text:
8. Let the applicant Shanoo Shukla be released on bail in Case Crime No. 41 of 2023, under Sections 366, 376 IPC, Police Station Badosarai, District Barabanki on furnishing a bail bond and two sureties each in the like amount to the satisfaction of magistrate/court concerned, subject to following conditions:-
(i) the applicant shall not temper with the prosecution evidence;
(ii) the applicant shall not pressurize the prosecution witnesses;
(iii) the applicant shall appear on each and every date fixed by the trial court.
9.

